server { ... }
Defines one virtual server (one site) — contains all config for requests that match this block.

listen 80;

Means: accept incoming TCP connections on port 80 (HTTP).

What to mention: use 80 for plain HTTP. For HTTPS use listen 443 ssl; (and add cert paths).

